1564
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:27,210
for the Sayuri Kambe murder case 19 years ago?

1565
00:08:27,210 --> 00:08:31,760
And the recent silencing of Imura
was done in the same manner?

1566
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:33,630
Exactly for what reason?

1567
00:08:33,630 --> 00:08:37,550
If he didn't do what they said,
