1568
00:08:37,550 --> 00:08:39,560
By who?

1569
00:08:39,560 --> 00:08:41,470
Shigemaru Kambe.

1570
00:08:47,270 --> 00:08:50,110
Are you saying a ghost is the mastermind?

1571
00:08:50,110 --> 00:08:52,650
I don't blame you for not believing me.

1572
00:08:52,650 --> 00:08:57,370
But it's an indisputable fact
that Cho-<i>san </i>and Takei were murdered.

1573
00:08:59,030 --> 00:09:01,830
There's no evidence that backs up what I said.

1574
00:09:01,830 --> 00:09:04,500
All I can say is "Please believe me."

1575
00:09:06,250 --> 00:09:09,920
Kato, you had a grudge
against Takei, didn't you?

1576
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:11,760
What do you mean?

1577
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:14,840
Why don't you ask yourself that question?

1578
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:16,630
What happened back then...

1579
00:09:22,850 --> 00:09:25,310
Kato, where are you right now?

1580
00:09:25,310 --> 00:09:27,270
I went around behind the perp.

1581
00:09:27,270 --> 00:09:28,900
You have a clear shot?

1582
00:09:28,900 --> 00:09:30,190
I can do it.

1583
00:09:30,190 --> 00:09:33,150
Use of firearms is authorized. Shoot!

1584
00:09:33,150 --> 00:09:34,240
Okay.

1585
00:09:45,790 --> 00:09:46,740
Apprehending.

1586
00:09:46,740 --> 00:09:48,120
Well done.

1587
00:09:50,750 --> 00:09:51,840
Get away from him!

1588
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:53,920
Hey... Hey!

1589
00:09:53,920 --> 00:09:56,170
You have to get away!

1590
00:09:56,170 --> 00:09:57,340
Hey!

1591
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:08,480
Who shot that?

1592
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,650
Everyone, please calm down! It's all right!

1593
00:10:10,650 --> 00:10:12,440
The hostages are safe!

1594
00:10:14,940 --> 00:10:16,700
Hey, is everything all right over there?

1595
00:10:20,990 --> 00:10:22,450
A toy?

1596
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:31,290
Haru. That woman was an accomplice.
It wasn't your mistake.

1597
00:10:31,290 --> 00:10:34,420
I'll tell that to the higher-ups, too.

1598
00:11:05,330 --> 00:11:06,180
That's true.

1599
00:11:06,180 --> 00:11:06,660
Yeah.

1600
00:11:06,660 --> 00:11:08,160
What the hell?

1601
00:11:08,160 --> 00:11:09,910
Grow up, Haru!

1602
00:11:09,910 --> 00:11:13,500
Please leave me alone.
I'm sick of your self-interests.

1603
00:11:13,500 --> 00:11:16,880
I will never accept this!

1604
00:11:20,800 --> 00:11:23,050
Are you running away?

1605
00:11:23,050 --> 00:11:27,680
If you run away,
you'll no longer be a detective, nor a hero!

1606
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:29,890
Kato!

1607
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:38,320
You resented Takei

1608
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:42,070
for shoving the responsibilities
of that case to you. That's why--

1609
00:11:42,070 --> 00:11:46,160
Grudge? I only have
feelings of appreciation for Takei.

1610
00:11:47,660 --> 00:11:54,580
The fact that I'm somehow still a detective
to this day is all thanks to Takei.

1611
00:11:54,580 --> 00:12:00,340
That's why I have to arrest the guy
who did the two of them in at any cost.

1612
00:12:01,990 --> 00:12:06,000
Fugou Keiji

1613
00:12:12,560 --> 00:12:14,690
Please wait! This is a trap!

