1745
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:18,920
TO  DAISUKE

1746
00:12:23,490 --> 00:12:25,030
Mr. Daisuke!

1747
00:12:30,290 --> 00:12:32,160
I can't hold on for...

1748
00:12:32,160 --> 00:12:34,250
Keep at it! Show some guts!

1749
00:12:34,250 --> 00:12:38,340
I've narrowed it down a lot!
I'll be picking up audio from here.

1750
00:12:40,050 --> 00:12:41,970
What is this?

1751
00:12:49,930 --> 00:12:54,190
In any case,
we have quite a mess on our hands.

1752
00:12:54,190 --> 00:12:56,440
Apparently the Prime Minister's
office is interfering

1753
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:58,900
and telling us not to touch the Kambe family.

1754
00:12:58,900 --> 00:13:03,150
We grunts simply do the work
that the higher-ups give us.

1755
00:13:03,150 --> 00:13:04,240
Hey.

1756
00:13:05,910 --> 00:13:07,120
This...

1757
00:13:08,030 --> 00:13:11,180
...apparently came out from Takei's desk.

