1994
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:24,120
LETTER OF RESIGNATION

1995
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:29,410
The fact that I'm somehow still a detective
to this day is all thanks to Takei.

1996
00:13:44,990 --> 00:13:50,370
It's a nerve agent.
Perhaps they're trying to abduct you.

1997
00:13:50,370 --> 00:13:53,870
That means he still has to be
somewhere nearby.

1998
00:13:53,870 --> 00:13:57,170
He met up with someone 25 minutes ago.

1999
00:14:00,630 --> 00:14:02,590
Frantz Weinski.

2000
00:14:02,590 --> 00:14:06,800
He's the personal bodyguard of Thomas Matheson,
an international arms dealer.

2001
00:14:06,800 --> 00:14:08,090
Follow their trail.

2002
00:14:08,090 --> 00:14:09,220
Yes.

2003
00:14:11,180 --> 00:14:15,430
All surveillance camera data
in the vicinity is being deleted.

2004
00:14:18,850 --> 00:14:21,560
If it's being deleted,
you just have to create them.

2005
00:14:24,980 --> 00:14:26,650
What is this?

2006
00:14:26,650 --> 00:14:28,280
Moaning?

2007
00:14:28,280 --> 00:14:32,700
Of course not. Please keep your hobbies
separate from your work.

2008
00:14:33,700 --> 00:14:36,330
Doesn't it kinda sound like a boat engine?

2009
00:14:36,330 --> 00:14:39,460
Oh right, Yumoto, you head over
to the boat races often, huh?

2010
00:14:39,460 --> 00:14:42,460
I'm telling you, please keep
your hobbies separate from your work!

2011
00:14:42,460 --> 00:14:43,880
Quiet!

2012
00:14:46,300 --> 00:14:49,130
This is moaning after all.

2013
00:14:49,130 --> 00:14:52,720
No, these are seagulls. No doubt about it.

2014
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:54,430
Are you sure?

2015
00:14:54,430 --> 00:14:57,680
If there are seagulls,
that means they're close to the ocean.

2016
00:14:58,890 --> 00:15:00,230
A steam whistle!

2017
00:15:00,230 --> 00:15:02,440
And it's a pretty huge boat.

2018
00:15:02,440 --> 00:15:05,030
The signal reception area
is roughly 10 kilometers.

2019
00:15:05,030 --> 00:15:09,030
Within this radius,
a place where large boats can anchor is...

2020
00:15:10,700 --> 00:15:13,200
Did you hear that, Kato?

2021
00:15:14,160 --> 00:15:16,450
Yeah. We're rushing over there.

2022
00:15:21,710 --> 00:15:24,210
We'll be arriving in about 30 minutes.

2023
00:15:24,210 --> 00:15:26,500
Please don't be too reckless--

2024
00:15:27,490 --> 00:15:28,070
GRAB YOUR CAMERA
AND DO A SPIN!

