00:16:15,410 --> 00:16:17,920
Mr. Daisuke, I have a positive ID.

2135
00:16:18,520 --> 00:16:21,640
The perpetrator is headed for Oura Wharf.

2136
00:16:28,730 --> 00:16:30,190
Where's Kato?

2137
00:16:30,190 --> 00:16:33,410
He went ahead. I did try to stop him, though.

2138
00:16:33,410 --> 00:16:35,910
Went ahead? To where?

2139
00:16:47,290 --> 00:16:49,300
This doesn't look good.

2140
00:16:49,300 --> 00:16:52,130
Can't you make a more decent report?

2141
00:16:52,130 --> 00:16:55,430
Well, "not good" is the only way I can phrase...

2142
00:16:55,430 --> 00:16:57,350
That ship is registered to Panama.

2143
00:16:57,350 --> 00:16:59,410
Legally speaking,
that ship is a foreign country.

2144
00:16:59,410 --> 00:17:00,780
You'd need a passport--

2145
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:02,250
Don't give me trivia in a situation like this!

2146
00:17:02,270 --> 00:17:06,060
Wouldn't it be better if you just took photos
and came back for now?

2147
00:17:07,610 --> 00:17:10,860
This isn't good! The ship is leaving the port!

2148
00:17:20,330 --> 00:17:22,000
Kambe.

2149
00:17:24,290 --> 00:17:27,330
There's a location on this ship
that I cannot scan.

2150
00:17:27,330 --> 00:17:30,170
I still believe the possibility
of a trap is high.

2151
00:17:30,170 --> 00:17:33,880
Trap or not, I have to confirm it myself.

2152
00:17:35,510 --> 00:17:38,050
I have sent you an Active Support Veil.

2153
00:17:42,020 --> 00:17:44,930
Inspector Kambe, what are you planning?

2154
00:17:46,390 --> 00:17:49,020
Shigemaru Kambe is aboard that ship.

2155
00:17:49,020 --> 00:17:51,070
So is Kato.

2156
00:17:51,070 --> 00:17:52,400
Kato?

2157
00:17:53,490 --> 00:17:59,120
Two years ago, he no longer became able
to shoot a gun, and stopped being a hero.

2158
00:17:59,950 --> 00:18:04,580
But ever since you came, it seems like
he started longing to become a hero again.

2159
00:18:16,800 --> 00:18:20,300
How are you going to board that ship?
With a helicopter?

2160
00:18:20,300 --> 00:18:21,640
With a car.

2161
00:18:33,730 --> 00:18:35,530
Geez.

2162
00:18:45,080 --> 00:18:48,870
The object that approached us
from underwater has been destroyed.

2163
00:18:48,870 --> 00:18:51,710
Proceed accordingly as we planned.

2164
00:18:51,710 --> 00:18:54,170
How much of this is according to plan?

2165
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:05,640
Where is Shigemaru Kambe? Answer me!

2166
00:19:11,770 --> 00:19:13,940
What the hell is he doing?

